{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy/sqlalchemy/issues/4421","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy/sqlalchemy","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy/sqlalchemy/issues/4421/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy/sqlalchemy/issues/4421/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy/sqlalchemy/issues/4421/events","html_url":"https://github.com/sqlalchemy/sqlalchemy/issues/4421","id":394799947,"node_id":"MDU6SXNzdWUzOTQ3OTk5NDc=","number":4421,"title":"should non-primary mapper loader options inspect the primary mapper for attributes not locally present?","user":{"login":"ariloulaleelay","id":886694,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg4NjY5NA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/886694?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ariloulaleelay","html_url":"https://github.com/ariloulaleelay","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ariloulaleelay/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ariloulaleelay/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ariloulaleelay/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ariloulaleelay/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ariloulaleelay/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ariloulaleelay/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ariloulaleelay/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ariloulaleelay/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ariloulaleelay/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":1141269142,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMTQxMjY5MTQy","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy/sqlalchemy/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"d73a4a","default":true,"description":"Something isn't working"},{"id":1141273966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMTQxMjczOTY2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy/sqlalchemy/labels/orm","name":"orm","color":"20C0B0","default":false,"description":null},{"id":1141898191,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMTQxODk4MTkx","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy/sqlalchemy/labels/loader%20options","name":"loader options","color":"b3f29b","default":false,"description":"ORM options like joinedload(), load_only(), these are complicated and have a lot of issues"},{"id":1191668562,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMTkxNjY4NTYy","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy/sqlalchemy/labels/non-primary%20mappers","name":"non-primary mappers","color":"f2b798","default":false,"description":"things to do with the soon-to-be-deprecated non primary mapper feature"}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignee":null,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":8,"created_at":"2018-12-29T14:24:38Z","updated_at":"2019-01-25T16:58:27Z","closed_at":"2019-01-25T16:58:27Z","author_association":"NONE","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"Load options ignored for non_primary mapper:\r\n\r\n```python\r\n#!/usr/bin/env python\r\n\r\nimport sqlalchemy\r\n\r\nfrom sqlalchemy import Column, ForeignKey, Integer, create_engine, orm\r\nfrom sqlalchemy.ext.declarative import declarative_base\r\n\r\nBase = declarative_base()\r\n\r\n\r\nclass Parent(Base):\r\n    __tablename__ = 'parents'\r\n    id = Column(Integer, primary_key=True)\r\n\r\n\r\nclass Child(Base):\r\n    __tablename__ = 'children'\r\n    id = Column(Integer, primary_key=True)\r\n    parent_id = Column(Integer, ForeignKey(Parent.id), nullable=False, index=True)\r\n    parent = orm.relationship(Parent, backref='children')\r\n\r\n\r\naliased_child = sqlalchemy.select([Child]).alias()\r\nmapped_child = orm.mapper(Child, aliased_child, non_primary=True)\r\n\r\nengine = create_engine('sqlite://', echo=True)\r\nBase.metadata.create_all(engine)\r\nDBSession = orm.sessionmaker(bind=engine)\r\nsession = DBSession()\r\n\r\nparent = Parent(id=0)\r\nchild = Child(id=1, parent_id=0)\r\nsession.add_all([parent, child])\r\nsession.commit()\r\n\r\n# this works\r\nsession.expunge_all()\r\nchild = session.query(Child).options(orm.noload('*')).first()\r\nchild.parent  # no parent (ok)\r\n\r\n# this is not\r\nsession.expunge_all()\r\nchild = session.query(mapped_child).options(orm.noload('*')).first()\r\nchild.parent  # parent lazily loaded (not ok)\r\n```","closed_by":{"login":"sqlalchemy-bot","id":36047385,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2MDQ3Mzg1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36047385?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot","html_url":"https://github.com/sqlalchemy-bot","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy/sqlalchemy/issues/4421/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy/sqlalchemy/issues/4421/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}